m. The Dutch briefly took the lead coming out of the last corner, but " [:a {:href "/athletes/16062"} "Maurice Peeters"] " suddenly steered upwards and was unable to keep a straight line. In the book " [:strong {} "Gouden Boek van de Nederlandse Olympiers"] ", by Tony Bijkerk, Ruud Pauuw notes that " [:a {:href "/athletes/13684"} "Gerardus Bosch van Drakestein"] " later explained that Peeters often drank a glass of cognac before each race. Before the Olympic final, he had emptied the entire bottle, which explained the strange performance, and the fact that Peeters was grinning and smiling strangely after the race."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Pair"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/13919"} "Lucien Choury"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/14034"} "Jean Cugnot"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/FRA.png"}] "FRA"]] [:td {} "14.0 (1 h2)"] [:td {} "12.6 (1 h1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/14655"} "Willy Falck Hansen"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/14648"} "Edmund Hansen"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/DEN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/DEN.png"}] "DEN"]] [:td {} "12.8 (1 h3)"] [:td {} "– (2 h1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/13684"} "Gerard, Jonkheer Bosch van Drakestein"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/16062"} "Maurice Peeters"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/NED"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.